<title>CHILE: Chile's CCU H1 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Chile's CCU H1 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean brewery Compania Cervecerias Unidas SA reported the following results in the first six months of the year.</p>
<p>			  H1 1997		H1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit	     14.11     profit   8.04</p>
<p>Operating profit     18.66     profit  12.00</p>
<p>Non-operating loss   16.80	 loss   2.72</p>
<p>Total revenues	121.79		109.64</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
